,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_ONE"],"1 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiwmdG3vdKWAxX8nq8BHcKqDVcQ3YcHCHsoAA"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiwmdG3vdKWAxX8nq8BHcKqDVcQ3YcHCHwoAQ"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwiwmdG3vdKWAxX8nq8BHcKqDVcQ3IcHCHooCw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiwmdG3vdKWAxX8nq8BHcKqDVcQ3YcHCH4oAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiwmdG3vdKWAxX8nq8BHcKqDVcQ3IcHCH0oDA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiwmdG3vdKWAxX8nq8BHcKqDVcQ3YcHCIABKAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwiwmdG3vdKWAxX8nq8BHcKqDVcQ3IcHCH8oDQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["2026.05.29\n\n在公館商圈附近的小巷裡面。\n\n店內空間不算寬敞。可以免費無限次加麵，可以調整湯頭濃淡跟麵條軟硬，但似乎沒看到可以選擇不同麵條。\n\n可以自取開水跟小菜豆芽菜，但是我們去的時候已經下午3點多了，檯面上的都吃光光了，所以沒有吃到。\n\n我吃極上蕈菇貝貝拉麵。松露跟菇菇的味道都很濃很棒，湯頭我選擇鹽味，整體喝起來很濃郁，干貝跟叉燒的肉質也很好。\n\n只是我是平常喝比較清淡湯頭的人，所以我覺得湯頭一般對我來說還是有點太鹹，建議跟我同樣口味喜好的可以選湯頭淡。\n\n麵條我選硬，也是真的剛剛好的硬。\n\n朋友吃柚香貝出汁拉麵，是真的有柚子的味道很香～",null,[0,25]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3ZDFsdFNuZFNSMFpvV214d1VXSldUbFJWVkZsNFVXdEdXRkpXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3ZDFsdFNuZFNSMFpvV214d1VXSldUbFJWVkZsNFVXdEdXRkpXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3ZDFsdFNuZFNSMFpvV214d1VXSldUbFJWVkZsNFVXdEdXRkpXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjV3ZDFsdFNuZFNSMFpvV214d1VXSldUbFJWVkZsNFVXdEd