l,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這次點了兩款拉麵，體驗落差頗大。醬油柚香貝出汁拉麵讓人失望，湯頭鹹度過高，掩蓋了海鮮的鮮甜，且完全感受不到標榜的柚子清香，整體口味失衡，僅給兩星。\n相較之下，泡系黑松露雞豚拉麵表現穩健許多。湯頭質地綿密、口感濃郁，黑松露的香氣與雞豚基底結合得相當協調，喝起來有層次感，給予三星評價。",null,[0,141]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTTJJemJGWlZla0pSVjBWMFQxcFdPWFZOVXpBeldXMDVUMk5zUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTTJJemJGWlZla0pSVjBWMFQxcFdPWFZOVXpBeldXMDVUMk5zUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTTJJemJGWlZla0pSVjBWMFQxcFdPWFZOVXpBeldXMDVUMk5zUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTTJJemJGWlZla0pSVjBWMFQxcFdPWFZOVXpBeldXMDVUMk5zUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTTJJemJGWlZla0pSVjBWMFQxcFdPWFZOVXpBeldXMDVUMk5zUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12286942624022503511/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBCTTJJemJGWlZla0pSVjBWMFQxcFdPWFZOVXpBeldXMDVUMk5zUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,5470,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBM2IzbFZVekJRV0V0T1pWOXVNUzAzWW05T2NsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xdb52b7a7d5318149!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjA3b3lVUzBQWEtOZV9uMS03Ym9OclE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBM2IzbFZVekJRV0V0T1pWOXVNUzAzWW05T2NsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBM2IzbFZVekJRV0V0T1pWOXVNUzAzWW05T2NsRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pBM2IzbFZVekJRV0V0T1pWOXVNUzAzWW05T2NsRRILMGRYLUJtb3dJcXYaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qQTNiM2xWVXpCUVdFdE9aVjl1TVMwM